<title>KUWAIT: Stealth aircraft arrive in Kuwait - source.</title>
<headline>Stealth aircraft arrive in Kuwait - source.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight U.S. Stealth bombers arrived in Kuwait on Friday, a military source said.</p>
<p>He said by telephone that the radar-evading planes had flown in from New Mexico to a military airfield in the Gulf state in the early evening after a 20-hour, non-stop flight. There were no further details.</p>
</text>
